<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan exempts investment in shares.</title>
<headline>Pakistan exempts investment in shares.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan has exempted from wealth tax 50 percent of investments in equitites to boost local stock markets, Finance Minister Sartaj Aziz said on Saturday.</p>
<p>He told a news conference the change was part of the budget for fiscal 1997/98 (July-June) which he announced on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Islamabad newsroom 9251-274757</p>
</text>
